  "title": "Parallax occlusion mapped procedural bricks",
  "purpose": "Brick wall with real-looking depth on a flat surface: the view ray is marched through a procedural brick heightfield in tangent space, so mortar lines sink, bricks occlude each other at angles, and the normal comes from the same height.",
